# Local env files.
#
# .env.local and .env.*.local are ignored: they are a machine's own overrides.
# The per-mode files ARE committed — .env.development, .env.staging,
# .env.production — because a build needs them to pick up the right settings
# without configuration, and because the expected shape of each belongs in the
# repository where it can be reviewed. They hold no secrets: everything VITE_
# prefixed is inlined into the bundle and readable by anyone who opens the app.
# Secrets live in backend/.env.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

!.env.example
!.env.development
!.env.staging
!.env.production

